How can we generate a job description for a product manager that aligns with our company's values of sustainability and social responsibility using Swift code? Can you provide a sample code that emphasizes these key qualities in the job description?
Here's a sample Swift code that can generate a job description:
```
struct JobDescription {
  var title: String
  var responsibilities: [String]
  var qualifications: [String]
  var values: [String]

  func generateDescription() -> String {
    var description = "\(title)\n\nResponsibilities:\n"
    for responsibility in responsibilities {
      description += "- \(responsibility)\n"
    }
    description += "\nQualifications:\n"
    for qualification in qualifications {
      description += "- \(qualification)\n"
    }
    description += "\nValues:\n"
    for value in values {
      description += "- \(value)\n"
    }
    return description
  }
}
let sustainabilityValues = ["sustainability", "environmental", "green", "renewable"]
let socialResponsibilityValues = ["social responsibility", "ethical", "fair", "diverse"]
let productManagerDescription = JobDescription(
  title: "Product Manager",
  responsibilities: [
    "Lead cross-functional teams to develop and launch new products",
    "Identify and prioritize product features based on customer needs and market trends",
    "Create and execute go-to-market strategies to drive product adoption"
  ],
  qualifications: [
    "Bachelor's degree in Business Administration, Marketing or related field",
    "3+ years of product management experience in a technology company",
    "Excellent analytical and problem-solving skills"
  ],
  values: sustainabilityValues + socialResponsibilityValues
)
let description = productManagerDescription.generateDescription()
print(description)
```
This code defines a `JobDescription` struct with `title`, `responsibilities`, `qualifications`, and `values` properties. The `generateDescription()` method creates a formatted string that combines all the properties, with each value listed as a bullet point. The `sustainabilityValues` and `socialResponsibilityValues` arrays contain keywords that align with the company's values, and these values are included in the `values` property of the `productManagerDescription` instance. Running this code will output the formatted job description that includes the values of sustainability and social responsibility.

